{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065144/block/singleImage/3274873/wm/01M82E11TGA02E8JARMKQJJYWZ.jpeg?updatedAt=1795378511\"/><figcaption>《萬千星輝賀台慶》已在上星期四舉行，跨平台直播收視最高錄得25.1點。</figcaption></figure><p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》已在上星期四（19日）圓滿舉行，在匯聚逾200位藝員傾力獻技帶來連場大型精彩表演，加上邀來昔日愛將羅家良、許志安擔任嘉賓，跨平台直播收視錄得最高25.1點，觀眾人數162萬。與此同時，TVB官方社交平台影片播放量更超過2,400萬（升35%），成績飲得杯落。 及後在慶功宴上，主席許濤與一眾藝人打成一片，他更表示，明年公司60周年一定要與更多平台及第三方合作，並主張加強自家內容創作方向，依靠大家一起創作，之後大家努力做好作品。現場藝人最感開心的，是主席透露明年有多個工作機會。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065144/block/singleImage/3274875/wm/01M82E56WR79T6618GTN4FGKJK.jpeg?updatedAt=1795378511\"/><figcaption>TVB昔日愛將羅家良回巢任表演嘉賓。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065144/block/singleImage/3274876/wm/01M82E6CQ5M75ECNA5D2D398BX.jpeg?updatedAt=1795378511\"/><figcaption>《萬千星輝賀台慶》匯聚逾200位藝員傾力獻技帶來連場大型精彩表演。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065144/block/singleImage/3274877/wm/01M82E5KDFA50PJ4PDPE5901AJ.jpeg?updatedAt=1795378511\"/><figcaption>許志安擔任嘉賓大唱金曲。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.713595+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":4,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:17.475439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:41.452924+00:00","content_hash":"6b017abdbce774b438585f8b9331f16f5f076aa1eae45581882f7bc96deba046","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.713595+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}